WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:02.855
Seventy-five hours, then a long quiet.

00:03.629 --> 00:12.264
Gene Cernan and Harrison Schmitt, the first scientist to walk on the Moon, stayed 75 hours and covered 30 km with their rover.

00:12.953 --> 00:19.369
After them robots landed three more times, and then nothing landed softly on the Moon for 37 years.
